        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 🔍 Distributed Tracing with Grafana Tempo & OpenTelemetry\n\n- **Service Name:** `sockwise-backend`\n- **Traces in Explore:** Open [Grafana Explore](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22P214B5B846CF3925F%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22nativeSearch%22,%22serviceName%22:%22sockwise-backend%22%7D%5D%7D) and select **Tempo** as the datasource to search traces by service, duration, or HTTP status.\n- **Trace-to-Logs Correlation:** Every trace is automatically linked to **Loki** container logs via the injected `[trace_id=...]` attribute. In Tempo trace view, click **Trace to logs** on any span to open the matching backend logs."
